{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-4","kind":"proposition","title":"圆内不过心两直线相交不得俱为两平分","englishTitle":"If in a circle two straight lines cut one another which are not through the centre, they do not bisect one another.","book":3,"number":4,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.4","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.4/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":4,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-4@raw-b9a91492a84f5394","contentId":"euclid-3-4","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b9a91492a84f5394070b0055486b963229d5b41bf605f6f05b58af914aa73165","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-4.statement","euclid-3-4.construction.1","euclid-3-4.proof.1","euclid-3-4.proof.2","euclid-3-4.proof.3","euclid-3-4.proof.4","euclid-3-4.proof.5","euclid-3-4.conclusion","euclid-3-4.historical.1","euclid-3-4.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-4.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-4","revisionId":"euclid-3-4@raw-b9a91492a84f5394","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5aabb7f7601ae0948dfb477dffa409bff058fa75e3d119266ed84ce4c168f871","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If in a circle two straight lines cut one another which are not through the centre, they do not bisect one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在圆圈中,两条直线相互切开,而两条直线不是穿过中间线,它们不会相互分割。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"圜内不过心两直线相交不得俱为两平分"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果圆内的两条直线不经过圆心，则它们不能全部被平分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-4.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-4","revisionId":"euclid-3-4@raw-b9a91492a84f5394","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"317104f14bab05c46737c747f785924ad6e57ee8474ba0e52a277199ec260ea2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCD be a circle, and in it let the two straight lines AC, BD, which are not through the centre, cut one another at E; I say that they do not bisect one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCD圆圈,让两条直线AC,BD,它们不是穿过中心,在E处相互切开;我说它们不会相互分割。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-4.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-4","revisionId":"euclid-3-4@raw-b9a91492a84f5394","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2bd8b1a8bcf76bef66a19a5db61ae9701774401e831d6583068062dccb2138f7","citations":["euclid-3-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let them bisect one another, so that AE is equal to EC, and BE to ED; let the centre of the circle ABCD be taken [[III. 1](/principles/euclid-3-1)], and let it be F; let FE be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"可能的话,让它们互相分割,AE等于EC,BE至ED;让ABCD圈的中心被占据,F圈被拉住;让FE圈被连接起来。 [[III. 1](/principles/euclid-3-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-4.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-4","revisionId":"euclid-3-4@raw-b9a91492a84f5394","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3cd1bb239dd7b1b56a4c2b4fd39fbda006e3a4e404ea32c40107ebc5947e6075","citations":["euclid-3-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since a straight line FE through the centre bisects a straight line AC not through the centre, it also cuts it at right angles; [[III. 3](/principles/euclid-3-3)] therefore the angle FEA is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,由于一条直线FE穿过中心,一条直线AC穿过中心,但绕过中心,因此,在直角时,它也将其切割开来;因此,角度FEA是正确的。 [[III. 3](/principles/euclid-3-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-4.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-4","revisionId":"euclid-3-4@raw-b9a91492a84f5394","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b3f84f0794930cdcb37a6552c715c188234b79f7d7b7fb2e1fa32caef4a2fbd","citations":["euclid-3-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since a straight line FE bisects a straight line BD, it also cuts it at right angles; [[III. 3](/principles/euclid-3-3)] therefore the angle FEB is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于直线FE线是一条直线BD线,因此也将其切割为直角;因此,角度FEB是正确的。 [[III. 3](/principles/euclid-3-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-4.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-3-4","revisionId":"euclid-3-4@raw-b9a91492a84f5394","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c218177f637683d7ea22d0cdca40d5a0e206e8aaafb59f3c3e63dec5366db550","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle FEA was also proved right; therefore the angle FEA is equal to the angle FEB, the less to the greater: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但FEA角度也证明是正确的;因此,FEA角度等于FEB角度,数量小到数量大:这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-4.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-3-4","revisionId":"euclid-3-4@raw-b9a91492a84f5394","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"10aad7563b9bcf55adb97563739622cca79bad82c9222c01850c9f67913ed89f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AC, BD do not bisect one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AC,BD没有相互分割。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-4.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-4","revisionId":"euclid-3-4@raw-b9a91492a84f5394","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-4.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-4","revisionId":"euclid-3-4@raw-b9a91492a84f5394","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f78adc7b734c71a48d3824f4e704849da88d54fda1364cfb50838d6e68e7b437","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"圜内不过心两直线相交不得俱为两平分解曰甲丙乙丁圜内有甲乙丙丁两直线俱不过己心〈若一过心一不过心即两线不得俱为两平分其理易显〉而交于戊题言两直线或有一线为两平分不得俱为两平分论曰若云不然而甲乙丙丁能俱两平分于戊试令寻本圜心于己〈本篇一〉从己至戊作甲乙之垂线其己戊既分甲乙为两平分即为两直角〈本篇三〉而又能分丙丁为两平分亦宜为两直角是己戊甲为直角而己戊丙亦直角全与其分等矣"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果圆内的两条直线不以圆心为中心，则它们不能同时被平分。说明如下：甲丙乙丁 在圆内，甲乙丙丁 和 甲乙丙丁 都与 己 平行，圆心 〈若一过心一不过心即两线不得都为平分其理易显〉，并在 戊 相交。命题：命题说明：两条直线或一条直线是平分的，但不能两者都平分。证明如下：如果不是，甲乙丙丁 可以在 戊 处同时被平分。找到原圆的圆心 己〈本篇一〉，从 己 向 戊 画一条垂线 甲乙。由于 己戊 将 甲乙 和 甲乙 分成平分，形成两个直角 〈本篇三〉，丙丁 也被平分，因此 己戊甲 是直角，己戊丙 也是直角。整个角等于其分割角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-4.source","contentId":"euclid-3-4","revisionId":"euclid-3-4@raw-b9a91492a84f5394","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2aaa3b74f49c40e00fe8773598525dba2026f72671e5fab9f23801bc6996f368","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.4/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.4\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-4:euclid-3-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-4.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"III. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-4:euclid-3-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-4.proof.2","euclid-3-4.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"III. 3"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-4:euclid-3-1:explicit","id":"euclid-3-1","book":3,"number":1,"kind":"proposition","title":"寻找给定圆的圆心","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-4:euclid-3-3:explicit","id":"euclid-3-3","book":3,"number":3,"kind":"proposition","title":"垂径定理与逆定理","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-circle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
